# Space-Themed Personal Portfolio Plan

This document outlines the architecture and implementation steps for building your space-themed personal portfolio. 

## Goal
To build a highly creative, single-page, space-themed personal portfolio for Junaid Khan. The portfolio will feature 3D elements, parallax effects, and smooth scrolling, utilizing a modern tech stack (React/Vite, Tailwind CSS, Three.js, Framer Motion, and Lenis).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]  
> Please review the following design decisions before I proceed:
> 1. **Tailwind CSS v4:** Tailwind v4 is relatively new. I will set it up using the `@tailwindcss/vite` plugin which is the recommended way for Vite projects in v4.
> 2. **Lenis Smooth Scroll:** The `@studio-freight/lenis` package has been officially renamed to simply `lenis`. I will install `lenis` to ensure you have the latest and most stable version, though the API remains identical.

## Proposed Architecture

### Global Setup
- **Framework:** Vite with React
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS v4 (`@tailwindcss/vite`)
- **Dependencies:** 
  - `three`
  - `@react-three/fiber`
  - `@react-three/drei`
  - `framer-motion`
  - `lenis`
  - `lucide-react` (for icons)

### Component Structure

#### `App.jsx`
- Initializes the `lenis` smooth scroll globally.
- Wraps all sections in the main Layout component.

#### `Layout.jsx`
- Contains the fixed glassmorphism navigation bar.
- Renders the `children` (sections) below it.

#### `Hero.jsx`
- Uses `@react-three/fiber` and `@react-three/drei` to render a full-screen interactive `<Stars />` background.
- Parallax effect on the stars based on mouse movement using `framer-motion`.
- Modern typography center-aligned.
- Glowing neon-bordered CTA button.

#### `Summary.jsx` (About)
- Scroll-triggered parallax using `framer-motion`.
- Renders a floating 3D geometric shape via `@react-three/drei` `<Float>`.
- Biographical text layout.

#### `Skills.jsx`
- "Solar System" UI representation.
- Holographic cards bobbing up and down using `framer-motion` `y` axis animations.
- Hover scaling (`scale: 1.1`) and glowing box-shadow effects.

#### `Projects.jsx`
- Horizontal scroll container using `framer-motion` sticky position and `useScroll`.
- Futuristic project cards with glassmorphism (`backdrop-blur`) and border gradients.

#### `Contact.jsx`
- "Transmission Center" minimalist form.
- CSS keyframe pulse animation behind the form to simulate a radar/black hole.
- "Warp speed" hover effect on the submit button.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Steps
- Scaffold Vite project.
- Install all required dependencies.
- Implement global styles in `index.css` (Tailwind v4 theme setup).
- Implement all specified components.

### Manual Verification
- Run the development server locally (`npm run dev`).
- Visually inspect the 3D elements, parallax effects, and smooth scroll behavior.
- Ensure the app is responsive and works flawlessly on desktop.
